					"nextDialogs": [
						705120710
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705120710,
					"content": "不是啦，只是有點不放心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 705120711,
					"content": "萬一有好奇的路人湊過來看熱鬧，結果「呀~」地跳出來一隻魔物，「哐~」地給他一棒，就糟糕了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 705120712,
					"content": "為什麼要用奇怪的擬聲詞…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120713
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705120713,
					"content": "這樣聽起來才足夠危險呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 705120714,
					"content": "反正，我們原本就打算幫迪盧克的忙，幫人幫到底，乾脆多待一會兒，確認沒危險再走。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 705120715,
					"content": "派蒙也有了很強的責任心呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120716
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705120716,
					"content": "嘿嘿…倒也沒有啦，只是為了好喝的葡萄汁。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 705120717,
					"content": "#好，{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}再努力一點，等拿到葡萄汁，給{F#妳}{M#你}多喝一口！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 705120709,
					"content": "派蒙對地脈異常很好奇嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120710
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705120704,
